  "description": "RegistryHiveLib is a .NET library for offline parsing of Windows registry hive files. It supports advanced features such as key traversal, value data reading, SDDL access, and transaction log recovery. RegistryHiveLib 是一个用于离线解析 Windows 注册表配置单元（hive）文件的 .NET 库。支持键遍历、值数据读取、SDDL 访问及事务日志恢复等高级功能。For more information, Please visit https://github.com/cjhdevact/RegistryHiveLib.",
